; mnyororo.mapishi -- thibitisha kwamba vilivyogandishwa (msingi/mbegu.bin,
; msingi/mjenzi.bin na .hex zao) ni sawa kwa baiti na vinavyojengwa kutoka
; baiti 393 za mkono. Matokeo: jengo/mbegu, jengo/kusanyiko, jengo/mjenzi.
endesha msingi/mjenzi.bin gharama/mbegu-mpya.mapishi
sawa jengo/mbegu msingi/mbegu.bin
endesha msingi/kwanza.bin < msingi/mbegu.hex > jengo/mbegu_hex
sawa jengo/mbegu_hex msingi/mbegu.bin
sawa jengo/mjenzi msingi/mjenzi.bin
endesha msingi/kwanza.bin < msingi/mjenzi.hex > jengo/mjenzi_hex
sawa jengo/mjenzi_hex msingi/mjenzi.bin
andika mnyororo: mbegu, kusanyiko na mjenzi kutoka baiti 393 -- sawa kwa baiti
